WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.155
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.425 --> 00:02.665
THIS SERIES IS A FICTIONAL WORK PRODUCED SOLELY FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES

3
00:02.745 --> 00:04.025
THE CHARACTERS AND EVENTS DEPICTED ARE ENTIRELY FICTITIOUS

4
00:04.105 --> 00:05.145
WE DO NOT INTEND TO PROMOTE DISCRIMINATION AGAINST ANY PROFESSION, GENDER, OR GROUP

5
00:05.225 --> 00:06.025
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED IN THE MAKING OF THIS SERIES

6
00:06.105 --> 00:07.825
I'm not an artist anymore.

7
00:07.905 --> 00:09.225
I can't sing at the club either.

8
00:09.305 --> 00:10.745
I think I should leave.

9
00:10.825 --> 00:12.025
What did I do wrong?

10
00:12.105 --> 00:13.025
I just told the truth.

11
00:13.105 --> 00:15.425
Phatee really did stab someone.

12
00:15.505 --> 00:17.065
I was tricked back then.

13
00:17.145 --> 00:19.625
He raped me in the car.

14
00:20.225 --> 00:22.185
Phatee was the one who covered it up.

15
00:22.265 --> 00:24.225
He took the blame to protect me.

16
00:24.305 --> 00:26.265
I once promised someone

17
00:26.345 --> 00:28.665
that we'd sing onstage

18
00:28.745 --> 00:30.185
and play guitar together.

19
00:30.265 --> 00:31.985
Phatee! Ranne!

20
00:32.584 --> 00:34.305
Phatee! Ranne!

21
00:36.625 --> 00:38.505
What? Is that all you've got?

22
00:39.545 --> 00:41.665
You keep your head down while punching.

23
00:41.745 --> 00:43.865
You're leaving your back wide open!

24
00:46.825 --> 00:48.025
Hey!

25
00:48.105 --> 00:50.745
If you're this pathetic, cancel the fight.

26
00:54.905 --> 00:56.465
You're the one who should watch your back.

27
00:57.705 --> 00:58.985
Is that so?

28
01:00.225 --> 01:02.305
That ten million is going to be mine.

29
01:06.465 --> 01:07.705
Don't let your guard down.

30
01:18.065 --> 01:19.905
Wanna take a shower together?

31
01:22.665 --> 01:24.425
I'm not your playmate.

32
01:24.505 --> 01:26.545
Or do you want to be more than friends?

33
02:32.985 --> 02:38.825
Can I whisper it softly to your ear?

34
02:44.985 --> 02:48.385
Can I whisper it softly?

35
03:04.825 --> 03:11.305
Can I whisper it softly to your ear That I love you?

36
03:17.145 --> 03:18.145
Hey.

37
03:18.225 --> 03:19.865
When will you stop singing with your back turned?

38
03:20.465 --> 03:22.625
If I'm going to face someone while singing,

39
03:23.345 --> 03:24.785
it has to be you.

40
03:29.665 --> 03:31.225
You've started cracking jokes lately.

41
03:31.865 --> 03:33.305
I'm not joking.

42
03:33.385 --> 03:34.825
It's the truth.

43
03:36.385 --> 03:37.585
Here's your drink.

44
03:54.305 --> 03:55.465
You're back again?

45
03:57.105 --> 03:58.825
Japan is just around the corner.

46
04:00.265 --> 04:02.065
I'll have a mimosa.

47
04:05.385 --> 04:07.305
You don't get employee perks anymore.

48
04:07.385 --> 04:08.825
Full price for you, customer.

49
04:08.905 --> 04:11.145
Wow, you're so stingy with me.

50
04:13.825 --> 04:15.905
So are you back because you're broke?

51
04:15.985 --> 04:17.265
Or were you expelled?

52
04:17.785 --> 04:18.944
No.

53
04:19.025 --> 04:22.025
Linda said Tangmo and Yoyeh would be gone for a week,

54
04:22.105 --> 04:23.585
so she asked me to help out.

55
04:23.665 --> 04:25.105
They're short-staffed.

56
04:25.185 --> 04:28.385
Oh, right. I requested leave from the university,

57
04:29.385 --> 04:30.825
saying I had to attend a relative's funeral.

58
04:31.505 --> 04:33.905
So I put your name down. You don't mind, right?

59
04:34.785 --> 04:35.785
Your relative died,

60
04:35.865 --> 04:37.105
but you used my name?

61
04:37.185 --> 04:39.305
You little bastard!

62
04:39.385 --> 04:40.745
You're gonna get it!

63
04:49.225 --> 04:50.585
Hey, Vann!

64
04:50.665 --> 04:51.745
How come you're here?

65
04:53.265 --> 04:55.025
I'm filling in for you.

66
04:56.025 --> 04:57.265
Thanks a lot.

67
04:59.025 --> 05:00.905
-Hey. -Leaving already?

68
05:03.505 --> 05:05.265
Make sure you bring back that million.

69
05:06.585 --> 05:07.865
Hey.

70
05:07.945 --> 05:09.025
So, how about we

71
05:09.105 --> 05:10.305
make a guess for fun?

72
05:10.385 --> 05:12.425
Between Tangmo,

73
05:12.505 --> 05:13.585
Yoyeh,

74
05:13.665 --> 05:15.505
and the others…

75
05:15.585 --> 05:17.385
In this match, who's going to win?

76
05:17.465 --> 05:19.505
Wanna bet? I'll write it all down.

77
05:19.585 --> 05:20.825
Who's betting on whom?

78
05:20.905 --> 05:21.945
Okay.

79
05:22.025 --> 05:24.465
Then I'm betting on Tangmo.

80
05:24.545 --> 05:26.545
Good choice, Mr. Singer.

81
05:26.625 --> 05:28.945
Because I'm going to win anyway.

82
05:29.025 --> 05:31.465
What about you, Phatee? Who are you picking?

83
05:32.665 --> 05:34.505
Do I have to pay if I guess wrong?

84
05:34.585 --> 05:36.385
I don't have any cash.

85
05:37.385 --> 05:39.585
Who carries cash these days?

86
05:39.665 --> 05:42.105
You can just scan and pay with an e-wallet.

87
05:42.665 --> 05:43.985
I threw my phone away.

88
05:44.065 --> 05:45.065
Hey.

89
05:46.425 --> 05:47.985
Want me to draw some cards and spoil it?

90
05:48.065 --> 05:50.065
Whether Tangmo and Yoyeh will win?

91
05:54.785 --> 05:55.665
Shit!

92
05:58.425 --> 05:59.745
A combo of bad omens.

93
06:02.385 --> 06:03.665
One card was bad enough.

94
06:03.745 --> 06:05.185
But three in a row? Wow.

95
06:05.265 --> 06:06.665
Enough, enough.

96
06:06.745 --> 06:08.265
Tangmo is above fate anyway.

97
06:08.345 --> 06:10.105
These cards can't touch him.

98
06:11.025 --> 06:12.145
Talay's right.

99
06:12.825 --> 06:14.785
I'll be waiting for good news!

100
06:15.705 --> 06:17.265
Okay, thanks a lot, everyone.

101
06:18.105 --> 06:19.945
I'm off. See you, everyone!

102
06:20.705 --> 06:22.625
-Good luck! -Good luck!

103
06:22.705 --> 06:25.385
Don't come back covered in blood, Bro.

104
06:25.465 --> 06:27.865
Okay, I've written everyone's bets down.

105
06:27.945 --> 06:30.025
081…

106
06:30.105 --> 06:33.785
63442

107
06:34.825 --> 06:36.105
As for you, Vann,

108
06:36.705 --> 06:39.705
finish your drink and go help wash the dishes.

109
06:39.785 --> 06:41.505
The apron is behind the counter.

110
06:41.585 --> 06:43.865
What? I haven't even unpacked yet,

111
06:43.945 --> 06:45.025
and you're already putting me to work.

112
06:45.105 --> 06:46.785
I'll pay staff price for this drink, then.

113
06:48.225 --> 06:50.265
You haven't started working. Doesn't count.

114
06:50.345 --> 06:51.465
Look.

115
06:53.065 --> 06:54.745
Why are you raising your hand?

116
06:54.825 --> 06:56.705
-500? -500.

117
06:57.785 --> 06:59.105
I ordered it for you.

118
07:03.105 --> 07:04.545
Are you sure this is the place?

119
07:04.625 --> 07:06.225
There's nothing here.

120
07:06.305 --> 07:08.825
Yeah, this is the location.

121
07:08.905 --> 07:10.305
They said 10 p.m.

122
07:13.505 --> 07:14.505
It's exactly 10 p.m.

123
07:54.945 --> 07:56.505
Good night.

124
08:41.345 --> 08:42.904
Hey, Mr. Writer.

125
08:42.985 --> 08:45.025
How many lines have you written today?

126
08:46.505 --> 08:48.945
Don't count lines. Count characters instead.

127
08:51.705 --> 08:52.905
Then,

128
08:53.985 --> 08:55.625
shall we find inspiration somewhere else?

129
08:57.505 --> 08:59.545
This place has great customer service.

130
09:06.025 --> 09:07.425
I think Talay fell for him first.

131
09:08.865 --> 09:10.265
I think it was Sun.

132
09:12.785 --> 09:14.185
Ta-da!

133
09:14.265 --> 09:18.265
And this is the jar where everyone can try their luck

134
09:18.345 --> 09:20.945
and guess who fell for whom first

135
09:21.025 --> 09:23.065
between Sun and Talay.

136
09:23.145 --> 09:24.145
Wanna place a bet?

137
09:27.545 --> 09:29.145
I'm betting on Talay.

138
09:30.505 --> 09:31.585
Wow.

139
09:32.345 --> 09:33.865
You went all the way abroad to study,

140
09:34.745 --> 09:36.745
and you're betting just 20 baht?

141
09:36.825 --> 09:37.945
How could you?

142
09:38.585 --> 09:40.585
I exchanged all my cash for yen.

143
09:41.825 --> 09:43.145
I'll put some in for you.

144
09:44.425 --> 09:46.425
Bet as much as you want.

145
09:50.345 --> 09:51.505
So rich!

146
09:51.585 --> 09:53.065
I'm jealous.

147
09:53.905 --> 09:56.145
But if you like investing,

148
09:56.225 --> 09:58.185
there's another investment opportunity.

149
09:59.105 --> 10:00.425
Ta-da!

150
10:01.185 --> 10:03.345
Anyone want to ship these two?

151
10:03.425 --> 10:05.105
Talay and Mimi.

152
10:05.785 --> 10:06.625
The OG couple.

153
10:06.705 --> 10:07.865
Who's betting?

154
10:09.825 --> 10:10.705
Why?

155
10:11.425 --> 10:13.305
See? I've got no hope.

156
10:13.385 --> 10:15.825
He's dating someone else today, but maybe he'll date me tomorrow.

157
10:15.905 --> 10:17.425
-Wanna bet? -I'm in.

158
10:17.505 --> 10:20.825
-Go ahead. -I've got exactly 300.

159
10:20.905 --> 10:23.025
I'll put 100 in each box.

160
10:23.105 --> 10:24.585
One of them has to be right!

161
10:24.665 --> 10:27.505
Good luck! Get rich!

162
10:27.585 --> 10:29.465
That's more than my salary!

163
10:30.985 --> 10:32.505
Wanna bet?

164
10:39.025 --> 10:40.985
What's this "get rich" talk I just heard?

165
10:41.065 --> 10:43.825
Don't tell me you're gambling in my club.

166
10:43.905 --> 10:44.865
No!

167
10:44.945 --> 10:46.265
It's not gambling.

168
10:46.345 --> 10:47.585
It's just…

169
10:47.665 --> 10:49.705
a little guessing game.

170
10:49.785 --> 10:51.625
We're just

171
10:51.705 --> 10:54.105
guessing who fell for whom first

172
10:54.905 --> 10:56.225
between Talay and Sun.

173
10:57.385 --> 10:58.625
Wanna bet?

174
10:58.705 --> 11:00.265
How about this?

175
11:00.345 --> 11:02.625
Whoever gets lucky and wins

176
11:02.705 --> 11:05.745
must also put some money into the club. Simple, right?

177
11:05.825 --> 11:07.545
So you win either way.

178
11:08.785 --> 11:11.065
You work here, so you should share the money with the club.

179
11:12.145 --> 11:13.505
You're the only one left.

180
11:25.945 --> 11:27.585
The two of them

181
11:27.665 --> 11:29.665
are a test for each other, huh?

182
12:04.185 --> 12:05.825
Come on in. Long time no see!

183
12:05.905 --> 12:07.465
I'll get you some drinks. Come on!

184
12:07.545 --> 12:08.865
Sit down, sit down!

185
12:10.545 --> 12:13.305
LAY LAMOE BEACH BAR

186
12:15.745 --> 12:16.985
Here you go.

187
12:23.665 --> 12:25.105
Whenever I can't think of anything,

188
12:25.625 --> 12:26.905
I like coming here to sit.

189
12:44.785 --> 12:45.705
Talay.

190
12:47.105 --> 12:48.665
You finally answered.

191
12:49.305 --> 12:50.545
I thought you were an introvert.

192
12:51.145 --> 12:52.985
You didn't answer when I called before.

193
12:53.065 --> 12:54.545
You didn't read my messages either.

194
12:56.625 --> 12:57.945
I was busy back then.

195
12:58.745 --> 12:59.905
So where are you now?

196
13:00.465 --> 13:02.585
So you're not busy with work anymore?

197
13:03.385 --> 13:04.745
Are you free on Saturday?

198
13:04.825 --> 13:06.425
Let's grab something to eat.

199
13:06.505 --> 13:08.905
The cat in my room misses you so much.

200
13:10.625 --> 13:13.105
I'm busy. I have a date.

201
13:14.025 --> 13:15.705
Suit yourself, then.

202
13:18.345 --> 13:20.265
Why did you lie to her?

203
13:20.345 --> 13:21.785
You're free on Saturday, aren't you?

204
13:24.905 --> 13:26.985
I don't like that she wants something serious with me.

205
13:27.905 --> 13:29.385
Why not try talking to her first?

206
13:29.465 --> 13:31.025
She seems to really like you.

207
13:31.545 --> 13:32.865
Why are you so closed off?

208
13:33.865 --> 13:35.425
If I don't feel anything,

209
13:35.505 --> 13:37.065
I don't have to force myself, do I?

210
13:37.745 --> 13:39.945
Besides, I didn't lie to her.

211
13:40.985 --> 13:42.225
I really do have a date.

212
13:43.865 --> 13:45.065
With you.

213
13:48.305 --> 13:49.505
You're kidding.

214
13:52.785 --> 13:55.185
What? What are you thinking?

215
13:56.585 --> 13:58.505
We're doing research right now,

216
13:58.585 --> 14:00.465
simulating a date, aren't we?

217
14:05.385 --> 14:06.705
So?

218
14:06.785 --> 14:09.585
Let's hear what a protagonist like you would suggest.

219
14:09.665 --> 14:12.145
In a place like this,

220
14:12.945 --> 14:14.425
where it's this romantic,

221
14:15.425 --> 14:17.585
what would the characters do next?

222
14:20.545 --> 14:22.145
Find somewhere quiet,

223
14:23.225 --> 14:24.985
somewhere people won't see them.

224
14:26.265 --> 14:27.585
And then…

225
14:28.865 --> 14:31.505
What's going on in your head?

226
14:33.945 --> 14:37.465
What? Maybe they'd want to be alone together,

227
14:37.545 --> 14:39.185
open up or do whatever they want.

228
14:39.865 --> 14:41.265
What are you thinking now?

229
14:41.785 --> 14:44.585
It's a romance novel, not an NSFW novel.

230
14:47.785 --> 14:48.785
And then?

231
14:56.985 --> 14:58.025
It depends.

232
14:58.545 --> 15:00.465
They could take it back to the room,

233
15:01.385 --> 15:02.945
or do it right here.

234
15:19.105 --> 15:20.385
Sorry.

235
15:21.985 --> 15:24.145
What? Some kid chasing you?

236
15:28.545 --> 15:30.265
There's news about Pee again.

237
15:30.345 --> 15:33.545
Pee's released a new book. It's all over the damn news.

238
16:01.825 --> 16:05.185
Cha! What the fuck are you doing here?

239
16:05.265 --> 16:06.665
None of your business.

240
16:14.945 --> 16:15.945
Yoyeh.

241
16:23.145 --> 16:24.265
Ahem.

242
16:29.465 --> 16:30.985
Now that you're all here,

243
16:32.025 --> 16:35.945
allow me to explain the rules of this Werewolf game.

244
16:39.865 --> 16:41.305
This is a reality game

245
16:43.025 --> 16:44.225
with surveillance cameras

246
16:44.305 --> 16:46.905
recording throughout this mansion 24/7.

247
16:46.985 --> 16:49.185
All of you must live here

248
16:49.265 --> 16:51.945
and play the game here for seven days.

249
16:53.305 --> 16:56.825
The villagers must survive the wolves' hunt.

250
16:57.545 --> 16:59.865
Whoever is the last one standing

251
17:00.745 --> 17:04.065
will take home a prize of ten million baht.

252
17:06.145 --> 17:07.905
Among the ten players,

253
17:08.825 --> 17:11.305
there are two wolves in disguise,

254
17:11.385 --> 17:12.585
one bodyguard,

255
17:13.985 --> 17:15.785
and seven villagers.

256
17:17.785 --> 17:20.105
You'll find out your role

257
17:20.944 --> 17:22.105
inside this envelope.

258
17:25.545 --> 17:26.865
Be careful.

259
17:29.545 --> 17:31.505
Don't let anyone find out

260
17:31.585 --> 17:33.305
what role you've been assigned.

261
17:35.905 --> 17:36.905
Otherwise,

262
17:37.665 --> 17:40.465
you may be eliminated sooner than you think.

263
17:48.345 --> 17:49.625
Each day,

264
17:50.585 --> 17:51.945
there will be a mini-game.

265
17:52.025 --> 17:54.305
The winner will receive a prize

266
17:54.385 --> 17:56.625
or a clue as to who the wolves are.

267
17:58.385 --> 18:00.625
And every evening at 6 p.m.,

268
18:00.705 --> 18:01.985
everyone must gather

269
18:02.065 --> 18:03.985
in the Moon Room

270
18:04.065 --> 18:07.945
to vote on who the hidden wolves are.

271
18:10.425 --> 18:12.505
And if a player

272
18:12.585 --> 18:14.825
correctly identifies a wolf,

273
18:15.945 --> 18:17.465
the wolf will be burned

274
18:18.905 --> 18:20.145
and eliminated from the game.

275
18:20.865 --> 18:22.225
But if

276
18:22.305 --> 18:25.065
the players fail to identify a wolf,

277
18:26.105 --> 18:27.385
that night,

278
18:27.465 --> 18:29.225
the wolves will hunt

279
18:29.305 --> 18:30.745
and devour the villagers.

280
18:34.185 --> 18:35.265
Please proceed.

281
20:36.385 --> 20:39.145
Everyone, please place your devices, including smartphones

282
20:39.225 --> 20:40.985
in the bags held by our rabbits.

283
20:41.065 --> 20:43.425
They'll keep them until the game ends.

284
20:46.905 --> 20:49.545
Everyone, please place your devices, including smartphones,

285
20:49.625 --> 20:51.265
in the bags held by our rabbits.

286
20:51.345 --> 20:54.025
They'll keep them until the game ends.

287
20:59.785 --> 21:01.545
The game will end on the seventh night.

288
21:01.625 --> 21:05.025
Whether you're a wolf, a villager,

289
21:05.105 --> 21:06.145
or a bodyguard,

290
21:07.385 --> 21:09.345
there will be only one winner,

291
21:10.385 --> 21:12.945
who will take home ten million baht.

292
21:14.905 --> 21:18.105
What if the villagers vote out all the wolves before the game ends?

293
21:19.745 --> 21:23.465
Would the remaining villagers have to split the prize money?

294
21:25.665 --> 21:29.145
In that case, we'll have a special game

295
21:30.065 --> 21:31.705
to narrow down the villagers

296
21:31.785 --> 21:33.945
to just one ultimate winner.

297
21:36.185 --> 21:37.065
Ready?

298
21:41.185 --> 21:42.945
Now, if everyone's ready,

299
21:43.945 --> 21:47.945
let the game of Werewolf begin now.

300
21:48.025 --> 21:48.905
Please proceed.

301
22:20.305 --> 22:22.065
Player May, out.

302
22:28.905 --> 22:31.305
Player Natty, out.

303
23:20.905 --> 23:24.345
-Fuck! Why'd you shoot me? -Player Nack, out.

304
23:28.985 --> 23:30.945
Sorry, the barrel was pointing left.

305
23:32.025 --> 23:34.465
-Player Ploen, out. -Damn it!

306
23:44.745 --> 23:46.025
You little bastard!

307
23:53.585 --> 23:55.385
Why is he so good at escaping?

308
23:55.465 --> 23:56.745
Hey! Hey!

309
23:58.505 --> 23:59.865
You're not getting away!

310
24:00.785 --> 24:01.865
Stop!

311
24:06.065 --> 24:08.905
Hey! Who the fuck was that?

312
24:23.745 --> 24:25.665
Player Wut, out.

313
24:31.185 --> 24:32.265
Are you okay?

314
24:39.585 --> 24:40.905
Get down!

315
24:41.785 --> 24:43.225
Go! Go!

316
25:08.945 --> 25:11.105
Hey, four-eyes!

317
25:12.705 --> 25:14.425
Where the hell are you?

318
25:14.505 --> 25:16.025
Four-eyes!

319
25:18.825 --> 25:21.585
Player Au, out.

320
25:32.985 --> 25:34.545
I just slipped up.

321
25:53.345 --> 25:54.865
Hey, there's a door over there!

322
25:55.425 --> 25:56.505
Go!

323
26:05.545 --> 26:07.705
-Tangmo. -My gun isn't working.

324
26:14.905 --> 26:16.425
You almost took a critical hit.

325
26:20.065 --> 26:22.505
Your skills have really declined since you went solo.

326
26:23.625 --> 26:25.745
I think I should be the one saying that.

327
26:26.505 --> 26:28.985
Don't forget, I'm the one pointing a gun at you.

328
26:29.665 --> 26:31.385
Go ahead and shoot if you dare.

329
26:37.025 --> 26:39.865
Typical of you. Never plan ahead.

330
26:47.705 --> 26:48.705
Yoyeh!

331
26:58.385 --> 26:59.185
Fuck!

332
27:05.585 --> 27:07.985
Player Yoyeh, out.

333
27:08.985 --> 27:10.985
Player Cha, out.

334
27:11.785 --> 27:13.825
Player Tangmo, out.

335
27:19.305 --> 27:20.945
The game is over.

336
27:21.025 --> 27:23.105
The winner is Player Ohm.

337
27:23.185 --> 27:26.265
Please choose between a cash prize or a clue.

338
27:27.025 --> 27:28.705
I'll take the money.

339
27:28.785 --> 27:30.105
I'll take the money!

340
27:30.945 --> 27:32.985
You guys just walked right into my line of fire.

341
27:33.065 --> 27:34.945
Just wait and see.

342
27:35.025 --> 27:36.345
This four-eyes right here

343
27:36.425 --> 27:37.865
will beat you all!

344
27:42.465 --> 27:44.585
The winner has chosen the cash prize.

345
27:44.665 --> 27:47.425
All players who were shot, please gather in the main hall.

346
27:47.505 --> 27:48.825
Are you okay?

347
27:50.145 --> 27:51.385
I'm okay.

348
27:52.025 --> 27:53.625
Are you two reliving old times?

349
27:54.945 --> 27:56.225
I thought you broke up.

350
27:57.185 --> 27:58.985
What do you care?

351
27:59.065 --> 28:00.785
And why are you here?

352
28:00.865 --> 28:03.145
Didn't you say you'd join the national hockey team?

353
28:03.865 --> 28:05.185
Guess you've hit rock bottom.

354
28:06.145 --> 28:07.345
Tangmo.

355
28:08.665 --> 28:10.305
You're not much better off than me.

356
28:11.745 --> 28:12.985
You'd better watch out.

357
28:14.185 --> 28:16.585
I'll pay you back tenfold in this game.

358
28:32.185 --> 28:33.665
So what role did you get?

359
28:42.465 --> 28:43.865
I'm the bodyguard.

360
28:44.465 --> 28:45.625
What about you?

361
28:48.945 --> 28:50.265
Well,

362
28:51.945 --> 28:53.345
what do you think?

363
28:54.465 --> 28:55.465
A villager.

364
29:04.585 --> 29:06.865
The important thing is to find out

365
29:06.945 --> 29:08.545
who the wolves are.

366
29:14.225 --> 29:15.545
You guys were too busy fighting

367
29:15.625 --> 29:16.985
and we all got shot.

368
29:53.745 --> 29:54.785
Hello?

369
29:55.385 --> 29:57.065
So you finally picked up.

370
29:57.145 --> 29:59.705
I've been calling since morning. It's almost evening!

371
29:59.785 --> 30:00.785
How are you?

372
30:01.465 --> 30:03.025
I didn't sleep well last night.

373
30:03.105 --> 30:04.345
I still have a headache.

374
30:04.425 --> 30:05.905
Have you taken your medicine?

375
30:07.105 --> 30:08.105
I have.

376
30:08.185 --> 30:10.985
Just don't take more than the doctor prescribed.

377
30:13.145 --> 30:15.025
I know.

378
30:15.105 --> 30:16.105
Good.

379
30:16.705 --> 30:18.705
About the link I sent you last night.

380
30:18.785 --> 30:19.905
the one about Pee.

381
30:19.985 --> 30:22.785
I think you need to push harder to finish your novel.

382
30:22.865 --> 30:24.225
I'm begging you.

383
30:24.305 --> 30:27.425
I'm submitting the artwork and proofs this week.

384
30:27.505 --> 30:29.585
We're falling too far behind him!

385
30:31.665 --> 30:33.425
Okay. Is that all?

386
31:37.865 --> 31:41.065
Search for the latest work by the writer Pee.

387
31:46.345 --> 31:48.785
LATEST WORK BY WRITER PEE

388
31:48.865 --> 31:51.345
I WISH YOU WERE HERE BY PEE, THIWARAN CHINWARAWAT

389
31:55.065 --> 31:56.905
For as long as I can remember,

390
31:56.985 --> 31:58.305
since I've known you,

391
31:59.705 --> 32:03.345
I've never seen you thinking about a customer like this.

392
32:05.465 --> 32:06.825
That's not true.

393
32:06.905 --> 32:08.145
What customer?

394
32:10.545 --> 32:12.785
Do I really have to say which one?

395
32:13.785 --> 32:15.665
That writer, of course.

396
32:16.745 --> 32:20.265
You said you wouldn't take his job, but now you're always with him.

397
32:21.825 --> 32:24.465
You know, you're so inseparable that everyone here

398
32:24.545 --> 32:26.265
has started betting

399
32:26.345 --> 32:27.665
on whether you

400
32:27.745 --> 32:31.545
will end up with this customer.

401
32:31.625 --> 32:33.345
Did you secretly accept the job?

402
32:35.865 --> 32:37.545
I told you I didn't.

403
32:38.225 --> 32:39.745
He asked for research information,

404
32:40.505 --> 32:41.785
so I gave it to him.

405
32:44.665 --> 32:46.145
You didn't take his job,

406
32:46.225 --> 32:48.745
but he asked for research information,

407
32:48.825 --> 32:50.865
and you gave it to him for free?

408
32:50.945 --> 32:53.385
Isn't that what you'd call doing it willingly?

409
32:54.105 --> 32:55.545
I just felt sorry for him.

410
32:55.625 --> 32:57.465
I help where I can.

411
32:57.545 --> 32:58.865
Do we really have to

412
32:58.945 --> 33:01.105
think about personal gain all the time?

413
33:07.705 --> 33:09.105
You know, right?

414
33:10.465 --> 33:12.985
What pity can lead to?

415
33:19.785 --> 33:22.305
Are you ready to get into this game?

416
34:04.785 --> 34:06.105
Hello?

417
34:06.185 --> 34:07.185
How are you?

418
34:07.905 --> 34:09.344
Where are you?

419
34:09.425 --> 34:10.665
Why can I hear waves?

420
34:11.744 --> 34:14.065
Why? Will you come see me if I tell you?

421
34:14.744 --> 34:15.744
Just tell me.

422
34:16.344 --> 34:17.465
Tell me first.

423
34:17.545 --> 34:19.025
You'll find out if I'm coming or not.

424
34:20.705 --> 34:21.905
I'm at the beach.

425
34:42.945 --> 34:44.105
Hey.

426
34:44.185 --> 34:45.385
Come take a shower with me.

427
34:45.465 --> 34:46.545
Are you crazy?

428
34:47.425 --> 34:48.545
What's with you?

429
34:49.705 --> 34:51.105
Come on. I'll help you.

430
34:51.625 --> 34:52.865
Turn around.

431
34:54.264 --> 34:55.264
Let go!

432
34:59.865 --> 35:01.945
Hey, be gentle! It might get caught!

433
35:06.305 --> 35:08.385
The zipper's so small.

434
35:09.825 --> 35:10.825
It won't catch anything.

435
35:10.905 --> 35:12.345
You've got a smart mouth.

436
35:13.945 --> 35:14.945
I'm serious.

437
35:15.505 --> 35:16.665
We need to shower together

438
35:17.865 --> 35:19.625
and watch each other's backs.

439
35:24.705 --> 35:26.025
Who do you think is a wolf?

440
35:27.225 --> 35:28.625
Definitely Cha.

441
35:28.705 --> 35:30.265
Look what he did to me today.

442
35:30.345 --> 35:31.625
Imagine what he'll do tonight.

443
35:33.785 --> 35:35.345
Do you have a grudge against him?

444
35:36.745 --> 35:40.665
You pulled strings to get on the national team, so he didn't make it.

445
35:40.745 --> 35:42.985
I made the national team on merit.

446
35:43.065 --> 35:45.145
He wanted to win so badly

447
35:45.225 --> 35:46.825
because he doesn't want anyone getting clues

448
35:46.905 --> 35:48.385
that he's the wolf.

449
35:49.905 --> 35:51.665
But I think the others are suspicious too.

450
35:51.745 --> 35:52.665
Hey.

451
35:53.665 --> 35:55.865
I think it's someone else

452
35:55.945 --> 35:57.105
who is a wolf.

453
35:59.185 --> 36:00.345
Who do you think it is?

454
36:02.065 --> 36:03.985
The guy named Au.

455
36:05.825 --> 36:08.145
Did you have an ex with tattoos?

456
36:08.225 --> 36:09.585
Why are you so biased?

457
36:09.665 --> 36:11.145
If it's not him,

458
36:11.225 --> 36:13.385
another suspicious person

459
36:13.465 --> 36:14.985
would be

460
36:16.825 --> 36:18.585
the quiet one named Ploen.

461
36:20.105 --> 36:22.025
Why would an older woman like her

462
36:22.105 --> 36:23.665
be in this game?

463
36:24.705 --> 36:26.025
There must be something going on.

464
36:26.105 --> 36:27.185
But I think

465
36:27.265 --> 36:28.545
the guy named Nack

466
36:29.305 --> 36:30.665
is suspicious too.

467
36:31.305 --> 36:32.745
What about Wut?

468
36:33.465 --> 36:36.865
He doesn't seem very trustworthy either.

469
36:36.945 --> 36:38.985
But the most suspicious one

470
36:39.065 --> 36:39.905
is Ohm.

471
36:39.985 --> 36:42.225
He seems quiet and naive,

472
36:42.305 --> 36:44.185
but when he shot at us,

473
36:45.585 --> 36:46.945
he didn't miss a single shot.

474
36:48.305 --> 36:49.745
But anyway,

475
36:49.825 --> 36:50.745
I think

476
36:50.825 --> 36:53.025
we villagers should work together.

477
36:53.105 --> 36:55.345
Because at least if we find the wolves

478
36:55.425 --> 36:57.385
and they're all dead,

479
36:57.465 --> 36:58.865
the rest of the game will be easy, right?

480
36:58.945 --> 37:00.585
How do you know

481
37:01.185 --> 37:02.865
we're not the wolves?

482
37:04.225 --> 37:05.825
My instincts are never wrong.

483
37:05.905 --> 37:06.905
Trust me.

484
37:10.465 --> 37:13.145
It is now 5:30 p.m.

485
37:13.865 --> 37:17.145
Everyone, please gather in the Moon Room in half an hour.

486
37:19.345 --> 37:21.865
It is now 5:30 p.m.

487
37:22.625 --> 37:26.305
Everyone, please gather in the Moon Room in half an hour.

488
37:26.385 --> 37:27.945
Hey, wait up!

489
37:51.385 --> 37:54.065
Welcome to the first night's wolf vote.

490
37:54.665 --> 37:57.305
There are paper and pens in front of you.

491
37:57.865 --> 38:00.785
Write down who you think is a wolf.

492
38:00.865 --> 38:02.825
Fold it and place it on your right.

493
38:02.905 --> 38:04.345
As for the bodyguard,

494
38:04.945 --> 38:07.785
write down who you want to protect tonight.

495
38:09.465 --> 38:11.745
Can the bodyguard write their own name?

496
38:12.385 --> 38:13.785
Of course.

497
38:13.865 --> 38:15.385
That's selfish!

498
38:15.465 --> 38:17.585
If the bodyguard writes their own name every day,

499
38:17.665 --> 38:18.905
they'll survive until the end.

500
38:18.985 --> 38:20.465
The bodyguard's protection

501
38:21.345 --> 38:23.745
only protects against votes in this room.

502
38:23.825 --> 38:26.745
It doesn't guarantee survival from the wolves' hunt.

503
38:29.105 --> 38:30.665
If there are no more questions,

504
38:31.345 --> 38:32.345
please cast your votes.

505
38:48.545 --> 38:49.625
Who are you voting for?

506
38:57.665 --> 39:00.225
Once you're done, put your votes in the vase.

507
39:23.945 --> 39:25.105
And now,

508
39:25.185 --> 39:27.785
the results of the first night's wolf vote.

509
39:32.185 --> 39:33.305
First,

510
39:35.625 --> 39:36.465
Ohm.

511
39:38.425 --> 39:40.185
He got the first vote!

512
39:45.385 --> 39:46.265
Tangmo.

513
39:47.425 --> 39:48.745
Congratulations.

514
39:55.065 --> 39:56.425
Cha.

515
40:02.505 --> 40:03.585
Wut.

516
40:08.385 --> 40:09.585
And the final vote

517
40:10.185 --> 40:11.665
tonight…

518
40:16.305 --> 40:17.145
goes to Ohm.

519
40:19.265 --> 40:20.785
Congratulations.

520
40:23.225 --> 40:25.705
But we still have the bodyguard's protection.

521
40:26.305 --> 40:27.265
And tonight,

522
40:27.345 --> 40:30.505
the bodyguard has chosen to protect…

523
40:36.825 --> 40:37.945
Wut.

524
40:40.505 --> 40:44.745
That means the player voted to be burned tonight

525
40:46.105 --> 40:47.065
is Ohm,

526
40:47.865 --> 40:48.985
who is a villager.

527
40:50.185 --> 40:51.345
Burned?

528
40:51.425 --> 40:53.065
You don't mean literally, right?

529
40:53.145 --> 40:54.305
Of course not.

530
40:55.025 --> 40:58.065
It's just a metaphor for eliminating a player.

531
40:59.705 --> 41:02.625
We choose to eliminate players in a civilized manner.

532
41:09.425 --> 41:10.425
You idiots!

533
41:12.705 --> 41:14.225
I'm a villager!

534
41:16.105 --> 41:18.665
You've lost an innocent person!

535
41:19.265 --> 41:20.305
Happy now?

536
41:22.305 --> 41:23.865
But fuck it.

537
41:25.225 --> 41:27.225
At least I won the mini-game

538
41:27.985 --> 41:29.985
and got 100,000 baht.

539
41:43.945 --> 41:45.225
Hey! What the fuck?

540
41:45.305 --> 41:47.025
What the hell? What the fuck are you doing?

541
41:47.105 --> 41:48.465
Calm down.

542
41:49.465 --> 41:50.745
Calm down.

543
41:50.825 --> 41:52.625
-Hey, don't push! -Everyone, please sit down.

544
41:52.705 --> 41:54.545
Like hell we'll sit down! What are you doing?

545
41:54.625 --> 41:56.145
-Sit down. He told us to. -Yeah, sit down.

546
41:56.225 --> 41:57.865
-Go on, sit down. -Sit down!

547
42:01.785 --> 42:03.265
As you all know,

548
42:04.065 --> 42:06.345
everyone has signed a contract

549
42:06.425 --> 42:08.905
agreeing to the rules of this game.

550
42:10.985 --> 42:12.745
No one is allowed to withdraw

551
42:13.945 --> 42:15.465
until the game ends.

552
42:15.545 --> 42:17.225
And from now on,

553
42:18.065 --> 42:20.665
once you all leave this room,

554
42:22.665 --> 42:24.585
the wolves' hunt will begin.

555
42:27.185 --> 42:29.705
All villagers may use any area

556
42:29.785 --> 42:31.185
of this mansion

557
42:32.385 --> 42:33.945
to escape,

558
42:34.025 --> 42:34.945
hide,

559
42:35.705 --> 42:38.145
or defend themselves against the wolves.

560
42:40.865 --> 42:43.505
When the music plays in the morning,

561
42:45.025 --> 42:46.945
the hunt will be over.

562
42:48.905 --> 42:50.745
You will all get to rest.

563
42:53.825 --> 42:55.345
Please get ready.

564
43:03.985 --> 43:05.865
What the fuck kind of game is this?

565
43:17.385 --> 43:18.465
Yoyeh!

566
43:18.545 --> 43:19.665
Let's hurry!

567
43:39.905 --> 43:41.265
Let me go!

568
43:41.345 --> 43:42.305
Let me go!

569
43:42.385 --> 43:44.905
Let me go, damn it! I want to go home!

570
43:44.985 --> 43:46.785
I'm not playing anymore!

571
43:46.865 --> 43:47.785
Let me go!

572
43:47.865 --> 43:51.225
Let me go! I want to see my child!

573
43:51.305 --> 43:54.145
Let me go!

574
43:56.185 --> 43:57.865
Don't shoot me!

575
44:04.145 --> 44:04.985
‎Hey!

576
44:05.505 --> 44:06.345
‎Hey!

577
44:07.465 --> 44:09.065
Let me repeat the rules.

578
44:09.145 --> 44:11.905
Only one winner will leave this place.

579
44:11.985 --> 44:14.545
If any player tries to break the rules

580
44:14.625 --> 44:16.185
by leaving the premises,

581
44:16.265 --> 44:18.865
that player will face the ultimate punishment

582
44:18.945 --> 44:20.745
from our rabbit staff.

583
44:20.825 --> 44:23.825
As I said, you can leave this place

584
44:23.905 --> 44:25.545
in only one way.

585
44:25.625 --> 44:26.745
By winning this game.

586
44:27.305 --> 44:29.065
-Hey! -Don't!

587
44:29.145 --> 44:30.425
Don't go!

588
44:30.505 --> 44:31.945
-Help me first! -Come on, Yoyeh!

589
44:32.025 --> 44:33.225
-Tangmo! -Go!

590
44:33.305 --> 44:34.345
Help me!

591
45:06.545 --> 45:07.505
Hey.

592
45:14.105 --> 45:15.025
Hey.

593
46:05.545 --> 46:06.505
Hey.

594
46:07.865 --> 46:08.865
Hey.

595
46:11.665 --> 46:12.625
Hey.

596
46:13.745 --> 46:15.625
Is this really the time to play in the water?

597
46:25.865 --> 46:26.865
Hey.

598
46:28.385 --> 46:29.385
Hey.

599
46:36.665 --> 46:37.625
Hey.

600
46:45.785 --> 46:47.305
Hey! Hey!

601
46:48.625 --> 46:49.665
Hey.

602
47:42.545 --> 47:43.905
It's because of him, isn't it?

603
47:45.545 --> 47:46.665
The one named Pee.

604
47:52.865 --> 47:54.545
I happened to overhear that day.

605
48:11.505 --> 48:12.905
I have nothing left.

606
48:18.105 --> 48:19.705
My career.

607
48:25.625 --> 48:27.505
I used to have Pee by my side.

608
48:36.425 --> 48:38.345
I can't live without him.

609
48:42.465 --> 48:44.105
But you still have me.

610
50:43.345 --> 50:45.025
Come in! Come in!

611
51:02.585 --> 51:04.945
What kind of crazy game have you brought me into?

612
51:05.025 --> 51:06.985
How the hell was I supposed to know

613
51:07.065 --> 51:08.545
it would turn out like this?

614
51:08.625 --> 51:10.545
If we get out of here,

615
51:10.625 --> 51:12.345
I'll have to get your brain checked.

616
51:12.425 --> 51:13.905
You saw what happened.

617
51:13.985 --> 51:16.505
Ohm got shot. Blood went everywhere.

618
51:16.585 --> 51:18.065
And then there's Ploen.

619
51:21.225 --> 51:24.305
I wouldn't be surprised if a wolf ripped your throat out.

620
51:25.145 --> 51:26.145
Really?

621
51:27.225 --> 51:28.305
But…

622
51:29.225 --> 51:31.345
This isn't the time to think!

623
51:31.425 --> 51:33.065
We need to find somewhere to hide.

624
51:38.305 --> 51:39.665
Help!

625
51:39.745 --> 51:41.185
Help! Somebody help me!

626
51:41.265 --> 51:42.505
I'm begging you!

627
51:42.585 --> 51:43.545
Let me go!

628
51:43.625 --> 51:45.585
-Don't, Yoyeh! -I'm scared!

629
51:46.385 --> 51:47.385
You saw her.

630
51:47.465 --> 51:49.265
She was just running from the wolves.

631
51:49.345 --> 51:50.625
She was about to get out.

632
51:50.705 --> 51:52.625
Have you forgotten about the wolves?

633
51:54.065 --> 51:56.105
-It's coming! -Don't!

634
51:56.185 --> 51:57.145
It's coming!

635
51:57.225 --> 51:58.585
-If you won't help, I will! -Don't!

636
51:58.665 --> 52:00.585
It's coming!

637
52:00.665 --> 52:02.625
Hurry! Hurry!

638
52:46.905 --> 52:49.785
I told you not to trust anyone in this game.

639
52:58.425 --> 53:00.625
Don't follow me!

640
53:00.705 --> 53:01.945
I'm scared!

641
53:02.025 --> 53:03.185
-Please let me go! -Yoyeh!

642
53:03.705 --> 53:04.985
Yoyeh!

643
53:05.585 --> 53:07.185
We need to find somewhere to hide.

644
53:07.265 --> 53:08.545
Go!

645
53:53.105 --> 53:56.505
We have a werewolf kill. Villager Ploen has been eliminated.

646
55:34.025 --> 55:35.985
I'll take your job.

647
55:37.945 --> 55:38.945
What did you say?

648
